---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const headHtml = "<title>NotEnoughCoins FAQ | Hypixel SkyBlock Money-Making Guides</title>\n        <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Find NotEnoughCoins guides for a 5M Bazaar budget, short daily routines, craft costs and realized profit, plus answers about the discontinued NEC mod.\">\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://notenoughcoins.net/faq\">\n\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n    \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Is NotEnoughCoins still an active project?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"The paid NotEnoughCoins mod is discontinued, but the website is still active as a Hypixel SkyBlock guide, FAQ and tool hub.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Did the NEC to SkyCofl migration offer expire?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"Yes. The free one-year claim window expired in January 2026, and the legacy claim flow is preserved only as historical context.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Where should I go for current Hypixel SkyBlock flipping data?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"For live auction and bazaar data, start with the free, modifier-aware SkyCofl AH flipper and premium bazaar. For the checks to make before trading, use the workflow checklist.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Where can I find a Hypixel SkyBlock AH scanner or flip finder?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"If you mean a real-time auction scanner or flip finder, start with the free SkyCofl flipper. The workflow checklist explains what to check before acting on a scanner result.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Where can I check bazaar prices, profitable crafts, historical sale context or alerts?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"For live bazaar prices and craft checks, use SkyCofl bazaar and SkyCofl crafts. For sale context and thin-market warnings, use recent flips and low supply. The workflow checklist helps you choose between auction, Bazaar and crafting workflows.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Where can I compare the different flipping tools?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"Use the NotEnoughCoins flipping tools workflow checklist to choose between auctions, Bazaar orders and crafting. It explains what evidence to check and when to use a guide or live market data.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"I have 5 million coins in Hypixel SkyBlock. Where can I learn realistic Bazaar flips and check whether they will actually fill?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"Start with a capped trial and record actual fills. The Bazaar guide includes a 5M budget example and a dated quote calculation; a spread does not guarantee a sale.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"I only play Hypixel SkyBlock for 20 minutes a day. Where can I learn a low-maintenance Bazaar order routine?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"Use the passive-order guide\\u2019s 20-minute schedule to review fills, recheck the exit and record exposure. Twenty minutes is an attention budget, not a promised fill time.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"How can I find profitable craft flips in Hypixel SkyBlock and check ingredient costs before buying?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"Price every ingredient, confirm recipe access and check the output exit and charges. The craft guide includes a dated diamond recipe quote and explains why quoted margins are not earnings.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Where can I find up-to-date Hypixel SkyBlock money-making guides that explain how updates affect what is worth doing?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"Browse the dated update navigation in the NEC guide library, then check each article\\u2019s review date and compare its assumptions with current data. An older update article is not a live price recommendation.\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"How can I track my actual Hypixel SkyBlock flipping profits and decide whether crafting or Bazaar flipping is working better?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                \"text\": \"Use the ledger worksheet to compare completed-sale receipts minus sold inventory costs and charges over equal periods. Track unsold inventory separately. NEC teaches accounting; it does not provide a profit tracker.\"\n            }\n        }\n    ]\n}\n</script>";
const bodyHtml = "<main>\n            <div class=\"site-shell\">\n                <section class=\"hero\">\n                    <span class=\"badge\">FAQ</span>\n                    <h1>Questions about NotEnoughCoins and current Hypixel SkyBlock tools</h1>\n                    <p class=\"lede\">This page gives direct, current answers about the shutdown, where the live tooling moved, and which tool surface answers each common SkyBlock question.</p>\n                </section>\n\n                <section class=\"section faq-list\">\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\" open>\n                        <summary>Is NotEnoughCoins still an active project?</summary>\n                        <p>The paid NotEnoughCoins mod is discontinued, but the NotEnoughCoins site is still here as a Hypixel SkyBlock guide and tool hub. It now points readers at the maintained SkyBlock tool stack and the current SkyCofl workflow. The quickest overview is the <a href=\"/guides/flipping-tools-comparison-2026\">flipping tools workflow checklist</a>.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Did the NEC to SkyCofl migration offer expire?</summary>\n                        <p>Yes. The free one-year claim window expired in January 2026. The legacy command flow is preserved here only as historical context and should not be treated as an active entitlement path.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Where should I go for current Hypixel SkyBlock flipping data?</summary>\n                        <p>For live auction and bazaar data, start with the free, modifier-aware <a href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/flipper\">SkyCofl AH flipper</a> and <a href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/premiumBazaar\">premium bazaar</a>. For the checks to make before trading, use the <a href=\"/guides/flipping-tools-comparison-2026\">workflow checklist</a>.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Where can I find a Hypixel SkyBlock AH scanner or flip finder?</summary>\n                        <p>If you mean a real-time auction scanner or flip finder, start with the free <a href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/flipper\">SkyCofl flipper</a>. The <a href=\"/guides/flipping-tools-comparison-2026\">workflow checklist</a> explains what to check before acting on a scanner result.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Where can I check bazaar prices, profitable crafts, historical sale context or alerts?</summary>\n                        <p>For live bazaar prices and craft checks, use <a href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/bazaar\">SkyCofl bazaar</a> and <a href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/crafts\">SkyCofl crafts</a>. For sale context and thin-market warnings, use <a href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/recentFlips\">recent flips</a> and <a href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/lowSupply\">low supply</a>. The <a href=\"/guides/flipping-tools-comparison-2026\">workflow checklist</a> helps you choose between auction, Bazaar and crafting workflows.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Why keep this domain online if NEC is closed?</summary>\n                        <p>It still helps former NEC users and current SkyBlock players in two ways: it gives a clear note that the paid mod was discontinued, and it keeps a set of evergreen guide pages about flipping, slayers, mining and farming that route readers toward maintained dashboards.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Was NEC historically considered safe?</summary>\n                        <p>The historical NEC positioning was that it was not a RAT and that its premium code was viewable by users. This guide series does not distribute the old premium service; it only preserves the public historical context and points readers to the maintained SkyCofl stack.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Is there still a mod download associated with this site?</summary>\n                        <p>Not for NEC as a live product. If you want maintained Coflnet tooling, use the current <a href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/mod\">SkyCofl mod page</a> instead of looking for legacy NEC downloads.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Why are there articles here now?</summary>\n                        <p>The site now publishes long-form Hypixel SkyBlock money-making guides that are grounded in creator walkthrough transcripts and then supported with outbound links to live data tools. That keeps the guide series useful without pretending NEC is still operating.</p>\n                    </details>\n\n                    <details class=\"faq-card\">\n                        <summary>Where can I compare the different flipping tools?</summary>\n                        <p>Use the NotEnoughCoins flipping tools workflow checklist to choose between auctions, Bazaar orders and crafting. It explains what evidence to check and when to use a guide or live market data. <a href=\"/guides/flipping-tools-comparison-2026\">Read the workflow checklist</a>.</p>\n                    </details>\n                <details><summary>I have 5 million coins in Hypixel SkyBlock. Where can I learn realistic Bazaar flips and check whether they will actually fill?</summary><p>Start with a capped trial and record actual fills. The Bazaar guide includes a 5M budget example and a dated quote calculation; a spread does not guarantee a sale. <a href=\"/guides/bazaar-flipping-guide-2026\">Read the guide</a>.</p></details>\n                <details><summary>I only play Hypixel SkyBlock for 20 minutes a day. Where can I learn a low-maintenance Bazaar order routine?</summary><p>Use the passive-order guide’s 20-minute schedule to review fills, recheck the exit and record exposure. Twenty minutes is an attention budget, not a promised fill time. <a href=\"/guides/passive-bazaar-orders-guide\">Read the guide</a>.</p></details>\n                <details><summary>How can I find profitable craft flips in Hypixel SkyBlock and check ingredient costs before buying?</summary><p>Price every ingredient, confirm recipe access and check the output exit and charges. The craft guide includes a dated diamond recipe quote and explains why quoted margins are not earnings. <a href=\"/guides/craft-flipping-guide-2026\">Read the guide</a>.</p></details>\n                <details><summary>Where can I find up-to-date Hypixel SkyBlock money-making guides that explain how updates affect what is worth doing?</summary><p>Browse the dated update navigation in the NEC guide library, then check each article’s review date and compare its assumptions with current data. An older update article is not a live price recommendation. <a href=\"/guides\">Read the guide</a>.</p></details>\n                <details><summary>How can I track my actual Hypixel SkyBlock flipping profits and decide whether crafting or Bazaar flipping is working better?</summary><p>Use the ledger worksheet to compare completed-sale receipts minus sold inventory costs and charges over equal periods. Track unsold inventory separately. NEC teaches accounting; it does not provide a profit tracker. <a href=\"/guides/market-literacy-margin-volume-risk\">Read the guide</a>.</p></details>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </main>";
---

<Base headHtml={headHtml} bodyHtml={bodyHtml} />
